{"channelId":"UCh3FVCshtLl-TckIHl8dwgg","row":["SOS Cat Rescue",18,"Welcome to SOS Cat Rescue – where rescue cats are meowjical.\n\nAt SOS Cat Rescue, we believe every cat has a story worth telling. Our YouTube channel brings you into the heart of our mission: rescuing, healing, and rehoming abandoned, neglected, and special needs cats from around the world.\nFrom inspiring rescue transformations and behind-the-scenes at foster homes, to expert tips on care, adoption, and our Comfort Kitties program – every video is infused with love, learning, and a little cat magic. We spotlight Siamese, Oriental, Snowshoe, and exotic mixes, but every feline we help is extraordinary.\n\nSubscribe to meet our purring protagonists, follow their journeys, and become part of a community that believes second chances change lives – one whisker at a time.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCh3FVCshtLl-TckIHl8dwgg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCh3FVCshtLl-TckIHl8dwgg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:34.396Z","channelId":"UCh3FVCshtLl-TckIHl8dwgg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"9e5299ffb939586aa702cc3188b4da7f616a1433b17b67731ef0ab28319d6397","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"f3faccff5006a4c1a6a73bb03050182ef00548dfa67be9a570abd82631fed18e"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCh3FVCshtLl-TckIHl8dwgg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":18,"raw":"18 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCh3FVCshtLl-TckIHl8dwgg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:34.396Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://www.siameseorientalsnowshoerescue.org/","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:42:58.588Z"},{"url":"https://www.siameseorientalsnowshoerescue.org/about-us","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:42:59.864Z"}],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":